# recovery.te - HarmonyOS Kirin 9010 recovery SELinux notes.
#
# HarmonyOS ships a custom SELinux policy (types prefixed aoco_ in the stock
# updater image). TWRP recovery runs permissive during bring-up
# (SELINUX_IGNORE_NEVERALLOWS and the recovery default), so no extra type
# enforcement rules are required to boot.
#
# If you later enable enforcing mode, add rules here for:
#   - access to /dev/block/by-name/* (UFS on fa500000.ufs)
#   - access to /data (f2fs) and /metadata
#   - access to the framebuffer/DRM and input devices
#
# This file is intentionally comment-only so it cannot break the policy build.
